  "releaseNotes": "v10.2.0: Native hybrid search now uses a persisted content_tsv column plus GIN index for PostgreSQL full-text retrieval, with SQL-side Reciprocal Rank Fusion (RRF). Existing Postgres tables require the documented migration before deployment.",
